      "content": "In an experiment, m grams of a compound X (gas/liquid/solid) taken in a container is loaded in a balance as shown in figure I below.<br><br>In the presence of a magnetic field, the pan with X is either deflected upwards (figure II), or deflected downwards (figure III), depending on the compound X. Identify the correct statement(s).<br><br> <picture><source media=\"(max-width: 320px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1ksdluekt/edfa78c4-179d-4123-ac0f-cdd8c2fc296c/809ddfd0-fdff-11eb-9f52-c59981316667/file-1ksdlueku-320w.jpeg\"><source media=\"(max-width: 500px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1ksdluekt/edfa78c4-179d-4123-ac0f-cdd8c2fc296c/809ddfd0-fdff-11eb-9f52-c59981316667/file-1ksdlueku-500w.jpeg\"><source media=\"(max-width: 680px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1ksdluekt/edfa78c4-179d-4123-ac0f-cdd8c2fc296c/809ddfd0-fdff-11eb-9f52-c59981316667/file-1ksdlueku-680w.jpeg\"><img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1ksdluekt/edfa78c4-179d-4123-ac0f-cdd8c2fc296c/809ddfd0-fdff-11eb-9f52-c59981316667/file-1ksdlueku.jpeg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2020 Paper 2 Offline Chemistry - Coordination Compounds Question 47 English\"></picture>",
